\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.4}{\ignorespaces This figure summarizes the workflow of the divverent agents of the system. The mission manager query is passed to the planner agent that decides what tools and agents have to be called to answer. The results are then passed to the Synthesizer that will provide a final answer. The synthesizer's response and the tools results are then passed to the critic that will determine if other tools are necessary for a more complete response. If so the critic will generate a feedback that is given to the planner for a plan refinement and another tool calling, only the new tools are going to be called if the inputs for the others are unchanged.}}{64}{figure.caption.62}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:funes workflow}{{4.4}{64}{This figure summarizes the workflow of the divverent agents of the system. The mission manager query is passed to the planner agent that decides what tools and agents have to be called to answer. The results are then passed to the Synthesizer that will provide a final answer. The synthesizer's response and the tools results are then passed to the critic that will determine if other tools are necessary for a more complete response. If so the critic will generate a feedback that is given to the planner for a plan refinement and another tool calling, only the new tools are going to be called if the inputs for the others are unchanged}{figure.caption.62}{}}
